    "text": "nbc39.com\nwebsite\nJackson\nJackson library to host family movie night featuring 'Dog Man' on July 18\nBy 39 News staff,\n13 hours agoFamilies are invited to enjoy an evening of fun and film at the Jackson Madison County Public Library’s upcoming Movie Night, featuring \"Dog Man,\" on July 18, from 5:30 p.m. to 7:30 p.m. The event will be held at the library’s location at 433 East Lafayette Street in Jackson....\n1",
